(7663123, 1249640, 96815, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the composition. The HDR effect has given an unnatural look to the sky which is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the composition. The HDR effect has given an unnatural look to the sky which is a bit distracting.', '2020-05-19 23:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663124, 1249634, 96815, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. Looks tasty. I like you choice of title.</td>', 'Nice lighting. Looks tasty. I like you choice of title.', '2020-05-19 23:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663125, 1249674, 96815, '<td valign="top">Nice choice to contrast the pop of red with a sea of green... and obviously this is an incredible hummingbird shot. Well done. I suspect I will see this on the front page.</td>', 'Nice choice to contrast the pop of red with a sea of green... and obviously this is an incredible hummingbird shot. Well done. I suspect I will see this on the front page.', '2020-05-19 23:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663126, 1249119, 96815, '<td valign="top">That''s more like... a ''pip'' of red, hah. Nice image over all. I like how the landscape cuts the canvas into diagonal thirds. Good use of leading lines to give context to the hiker.</td>', 'That''s more like... a ''pip'' of red, hah. Nice image over all. I like how the landscape cuts the canvas into diagonal thirds. Good use of leading lines to give context to the hiker.', '2020-05-19 23:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663127, 1249484, 96815, '<td valign="top">Similar compliment to the hummingbird entry, I like your choice to contrast the red against a green environment. Well composed and captured. I think I will also see this one on the front page.</td>', 'Similar compliment to the hummingbird entry, I like your choice to contrast the red against a green environment. Well composed and captured. I think I will also see this one on the front page.', '2020-05-19 23:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663128, 1248944, 96815, '<td valign="top">I like the action on this shot. Nice job on freezing it.<br/> <br/>Something about barely seeing the edge of the glass, but still seeing it, is detracting from this image for me. It makes me feel like I''m seeing some of the ''behind the scenes'' and pulls me back into reality.</td>', 'I like the action on this shot. Nice job on freezing it. Something about barely seeing the edge of the glass, but still seeing it, is detracting from this image for me. It makes me feel like I''m seeing some of the ''behind the scenes'' and pulls me back into reality.', '2020-05-19 23:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663130, 1249673, 96815, '<td valign="top">What a fluff ball! Nice image overall. A few distracting spots takes away from the clean background gradient which I would have wiped out in a flash. The tomato cage (I think) is also a bit too distracting for me.<br/> <br/>Also, not really seeing a ''pop'' of red.</td>', 'What a fluff ball! Nice image overall. A few distracting spots takes away from the clean background gradient which I would have wiped out in a flash. The tomato cage (I think) is also a bit too distracting for me. Also, not really seeing a ''pop'' of red.', '2020-05-19 23:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663131, 1249159, 96815, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice arrangement. I think I would have preferred to have the front two glasses removed as they just slightly lack focus and wind up distracting rather than adding interest.<br/> <br/>I like your abstract backdrop and lighting.</td>', 'It''s a nice arrangement. I think I would have preferred to have the front two glasses removed as they just slightly lack focus and wind up distracting rather than adding interest. I like your abstract backdrop and lighting.', '2020-05-19 23:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663132, 1249686, 96815, '<td valign="top">What a world you captured here. Beautiful image.</td>', 'What a world you captured here. Beautiful image.', '2020-05-19 23:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663133, 1249624, 96815, '<td valign="top">I like the frozen action, but it lacks the clean look that typically comes with this kind of image. It may be that it''s too busy from all the bubbles.</td>', 'I like the frozen action, but it lacks the clean look that typically comes with this kind of image. It may be that it''s too busy from all the bubbles.', '2020-05-19 23:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663135, 1249657, 96815, '<td valign="top">Slight missed focus on your strawberry which is your main focal point. As you don''t have any background to blur, and it''s a still life, it wouldn''t hurt to stop down a little more to get it all in focus and sharp.<br/> <br/>Other than that, nice image!</td>', 'Slight missed focus on your strawberry which is your main focal point. As you don''t have any background to blur, and it''s a still life, it wouldn''t hurt to stop down a little more to get it all in focus and sharp. Other than that, nice image!', '2020-05-19 23:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663136, 1248966, 96815, '<td valign="top">The crop it too tight to the top focal point for me.</td>', 'The crop it too tight to the top focal point for me.', '2020-05-19 23:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663137, 1249631, 96815, '<td valign="top">decent product shot, but lacks any further interest.</td>', 'decent product shot, but lacks any further interest.', '2020-05-19 23:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663138, 1249685, 96815, '<td valign="top">I think you were going for the high contract look, but for me, the lack of detail in the harsh shadows is too distracting.</td>', 'I think you were going for the high contract look, but for me, the lack of detail in the harsh shadows is too distracting.', '2020-05-19 23:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663139, 1249679, 96815, '<td valign="top">Nice critter. Good thing for his survival, he kind of gets lost in the busy brush. But for a photograph, it doesn''t leave an impression.</td>', 'Nice critter. Good thing for his survival, he kind of gets lost in the busy brush. But for a photograph, it doesn''t leave an impression.', '2020-05-19 23:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663140, 1249645, 96815, '<td valign="top">Good looking bird. The rest of the composition lacks interest which detracts from the photo. I also see some noise that gives the impression of poor image quality rather than adding ''interesting grain'' in this case.</td>', 'Good looking bird. The rest of the composition lacks interest which detracts from the photo. I also see some noise that gives the impression of poor image quality rather than adding ''interesting grain'' in this case.', '2020-05-19 23:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663141, 1249672, 96815, '<td valign="top">Missed focus on your main subject.</td>', 'Missed focus on your main subject.', '2020-05-19 23:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663142, 1249683, 96815, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. Nice scene and a beautiful sunset. In my opinion, this doesn''t really fit with a ''pop'' of red as it spills throughout the scene.</td>', 'I like this photo. Nice scene and a beautiful sunset. In my opinion, this doesn''t really fit with a ''pop'' of red as it spills throughout the scene.', '2020-05-20 00:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663143, 1249415, 96815, '<td valign="top">I know it''s tough to get rid of... but the wrinkles in the umbrella kind of spoil the mystery for me.</td>', 'I know it''s tough to get rid of... but the wrinkles in the umbrella kind of spoil the mystery for me.', '2020-05-20 00:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663144, 1249618, 96815, '<td valign="top">It''s a busy scene. Lots of similar muted colours with no focal distance separation.</td>', 'It''s a busy scene. Lots of similar muted colours with no focal distance separation.', '2020-05-20 00:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663145, 1249594, 96815, '<td valign="top">Ah, the Anderson Mill Limited District Senior Center is one of my favorite places to be!</td>', 'Ah, the Anderson Mill Limited District Senior Center is one of my favorite places to be!', '2020-05-20 00:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663146, 1249639, 96815, '<td valign="top">The muted colours make this scene look... real! hah. I''m so used to the eye candy saturation around here, this is a fresh change. Unfortunately, the composition doesn''t do much for me. You hid away your pop of red a bit too much to the point where it barely has an impact on the photo.</td>', 'The muted colours make this scene look... real! hah. I''m so used to the eye candy saturation around here, this is a fresh change. Unfortunately, the composition doesn''t do much for me. You hid away your pop of red a bit too much to the point where it barely has an impact on the photo.', '2020-05-20 00:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7663148, 1249646, 96815, '<td valign="top">I hope everyone is ok!<br/> <br/>As for the photo itself... it lacks artistic interest in my opinion. It kind of feels like a standard documentation-for-insurance-purposes kind of photo.</td>', 'I hope everyone is ok! As for the photo itself... it lacks artistic interest in my opinion. It kind of feels like a standard documentation-for-insurance-purposes kind of photo.', '2020-05-20 00:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
