(7663150, 1249245, 253397, '<td valign="top">How cool is this! Perfect title, shot and idea and adherence to the theme! Even the spacing between the utensils was perfection! Now this is what I''m talkin'' about. GOOD JOB!</td>', 'How cool is this! Perfect title, shot and idea and adherence to the theme! Even the spacing between the utensils was perfection! Now this is what I''m talkin'' about. GOOD JOB!', '2020-05-20 00:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
